SUMMARY:Painting with Plants
DESCRIPTION:$37 member / $52 nonmemberAges 12+\, all minors must be accompanied by an adult \n\n\n\nYou’ve tried watercolors\, oils\, and acrylics\, but have you ever tried daisies? In this fun\, relaxed class we’ll explore the fascinating world of natural pigments. Learn which plants make which colors as you create a watercolor-style artwork to take home. All supplies will be provided – just bring your creativity. \n\n\n\nPlease dress for the weather and wear clothes you don’t mind getting messy. \n\n\n\n\nsold out
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/painting-with-plants/
CATEGORIES:Adult Programs,Art & Photography
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://houstonarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Painting-with-Plants.jpg
END:VEVENT
