SUMMARY:Meet the Mowers
DESCRIPTION:Free\, Members onlyNo registration necessaryAll ages \n\n\n\nHouston Arboretum Members are the G.O.A.T! Join us on the Event Lawn for this Members-only appreciation event is designed as a relaxed\, drop-in experience. Members can observe the goats while enjoying the Trail Mix Grazing Station\, a self-serve snack station with assorted trail mix ingredients\, and informal engagement with staff and volunteers. \n\n\n\nAlthough petting is not allowed\, you’ll have plenty of chances to capture fun selfies with our furry visitors before they embark on their next adventure! \n\n\n\n\nbecome a member\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis event will be held rain or shine and will be entirely outdoors. Please dress for the weather. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2026 goat map
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/meet-the-mowers/
CATEGORIES:Membership
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://houstonarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Goats-at-Arboretum-Anthony-Rathbun.jpg
END:VEVENT
