SUMMARY:Beginner Birding
DESCRIPTION:$22 member / $37 nonmember (per person)Ages 12+\, all minors must be accompanied by an adult \n\n\n\nIf you have always wanted to get into bird watching but you have never picked up a pair of binoculars\, this class is for you! Join us for an introduction to birding\, including how to choose binoculars and where to find them\, how to read a field guide\, and where to find birds in Houston. Weather permitting\, we’ll also go out on the trails to practice real birding basics.  \n\n\n\nPlease dress for the weather and wear walking shoes. \n\n\n\n\nregister online
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/beginner-birding/
CATEGORIES:Adult Programs,Nature & Wildlife
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://houstonarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Beginner-Birding-16x9-Adobe-Stock.jpg
END:VEVENT
